    "ig": "7 anchorages your guidebook misses.\n\nWe drop the anchor at every one of them.\n\nCala Coticcio. Spargi yoga beach. Il Piana sandbar. Tavolara at pink hour.\n\nReachable only by boat. Anchored by us.\n\nJuly + August 2026 — link in bio.",
    "fb": "7 hidden anchorages in Sardinia your guidebook misses.\n\nWe drop the anchor at every one of them — places only reachable by boat.\n\nCala Coticcio (the \"Tahiti of Sardinia\"). Spargi yoga beach with white sand reachable only offshore. Il Piana tidal sandbar between two islets. Tavolara at pink hour with the granite mountain rising 565m from the sea.\n\nThis is the Sardinia tour buses can't reach. With Sailing 2 Wellness.\n\nJuly + August 2026 — last private charter weeks open. Link in bio for booking."
